    {"page": 1, "start": 1078, "end": 1117, "top": 451.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 247.8, "baseline": 462.62, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "Typesetting depends on small decisions "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1117, "end": 1165, "top": 465.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 476.06, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "repeated thousands of times: where a line ends, "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1165, "end": 1205, "top": 478.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 259.2, "baseline": 489.5, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "how much space follows a paragraph, and "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1205, "end": 1247, "top": 492.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 259.8, "baseline": 502.94, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "which words travel together across a page "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1247, "end": 1291, "top": 505.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 273.0, "baseline": 516.38, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "boundary. A faithful reproduction must make "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1291, "end": 1331, "top": 519.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 252.0, "baseline": 529.85, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "exactly the same decisions, because one "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1331, "end": 1373, "top": 532.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 261.0, "baseline": 543.29, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "different break early in a document moves "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1373, "end": 1423, "top": 546.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 277.8, "baseline": 556.73, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "every line that follows it onto a different page.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1423, "end": 1473, "top": 565.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 285.6, "baseline": 575.93, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "In the workshop the lamps stay lit late. Shavings "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1473, "end": 1525, "top": 578.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 589.37, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "gather under the bench, a kettle ticks as it cools, "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1525, "end": 1579, "top": 592.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 602.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "and the half-finished chair waits for its last joint. "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1579, "end": 1628, "top": 605.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 285.6, "baseline": 616.27, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The maker steps back, squints along the rail and "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1628, "end": 1672, "top": 619.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 263.4, "baseline": 629.71, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "decides that tomorrow will do for the glue.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1672, "end": 1720, "top": 638.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 287.4, "baseline": 649.15, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins "},
